keit, Gott der <hi rendition="#g">Selb&#x017F;tgenuß des Egoismus</hi><note place="foot" n="*)"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">Gloriam suam</hi> plus amat Deus quam omnes creaturas</hi>.<lb/>
